  - uncertainty-ensemble
  - transformer
  - deep-learning
abstract: "VERIDEX V9.1 introduces a Policy-Latent Diffusion Network (PLD-Net) that achieves 80.6% accuracy on multi-country content rating prediction, representing a +3.5% improvement over previous state-of-the-art. The architecture combines frozen text and cultural embeddings with a novel policy-aware learning system that extracts interpretable policy factors through hierarchical multi-head attention."

